# Microsoft 365 Core
# Focused on the family/school workload: Teams, OneNote, Outlook, Microsoft 365,
# OneDrive, SharePoint and authentication. Intentionally avoids broad microsoft.com,
# Xbox, Azure and unrelated developer/product traffic.
# Teams media IPs are from Microsoft's current Microsoft 365 endpoint publication.

